VALUES ('LII','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for residential and commercial HVAC equipment, refrigeration, controls, replacement demand, distribution, and service networks can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Customer capital spending and large programs can shift abruptly. Materials, skilled labor, supplier performance, warranty, or certification failures can disrupt delivery. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','LII SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001069202&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides LENNOX INTERNATIONAL INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
