VALUES ('LMT','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Program execution can weaken the owner outcome; monitor cost estimates, schedule, technical milestones, charges, and customer acceptance. Budget and geopolitical exposure can weaken the owner outcome; monitor appropriations, continuing resolutions, export approvals, and policy. Supply and production can weaken the owner outcome; monitor solid rocket motors, electronics, labor, quality, and lead times. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','LMT SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000936468&owner=exclude','LOCKHEED MARTIN CORP filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
